#19001
Entrance to the Elven forest.~
   Huge green trees rise everywhere around you, their trunks broad as
towers and their leaves so high above that the light reaches the forest
floor in soft, shifting patches.  An enormous wooden gate rises up to
the north, carved with leaves and vines so lifelike they seem to sway,
and a graceful wooden archway spans the path before it.  The forest path
leads back south.
