Foyer of the Temple of Kelloran~
   A large temple opens up before you to the south.  Statues line the
walls of the foyer, depicting warriors and valkyries, martyrs who gave
their lives for their lord.  Most are nameless now after many centuries,
but now and then a familiar face appears.  Above the doorway into the
temple hangs a great crest of Kelloran, gilded in silver.  To the north
lies one of the streets of Elrhinn.
