#19042
The altar within the temple~
   A large altar of white marble fills most of the center of this room,
its bowls heaped with smoldering incense whose scent makes your head
swim for a moment.  Light pours down onto the altar through a great
glass skylight, making it gleam.  The wooden walls are covered with
intricate etchings, most of them showing battles fought by legendary
priests devoted to their lord, Kelloran.  A tome rests upon the altar.
The foyer lies north.
~
