During the wars of the Third Age, when the throne of Cair Muhr
was upended by the armies of Glasgian, the immortal plains were split
in two.  The Ancient Ones whom previously ruled the realm from their
lofty thrones upon high were banished by an even higher, more mysterious
power into a more simple plane.  The became creators of the land and
arbitrators and other more mysterious positions which do not befit
the minds of mortal men.  
