verse stone stones script~
The verse reads: "Here sleeps Ilvaren, first queen of the wood, who
planted the trees that shelter her people. Each leaf that falls returns
to her, and each spring she gives it back. Take nothing from this place
but rest." Someone has added in smaller letters: "and perhaps a little
light for the road."
~
